  line 151: the duality maps vacuum beta to vacuum beta + pi
  line 152: no vacuum is duality-invariant once level 1 condenses (|phi_11| > 0)
  line 153: the duality is the beta -> beta + pi element of the left phase rotations exp(-i alpha N)

